cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software, please cite it as below, and cite ELSEPA (references below)."
title: "Electron Scattering Simulator: a complete PWA of ELSEPA software with GUI"
type: software
version: 2.0.0
date-released: 2026-11-19
license: MIT
repository-code: "https://github.com/The-Studio-of-Sadiq/Electron-Scattering"
url: "https://thestudioofsadiq.tech/Electron-Scattering/"
abstract: >-
  An installable Progressive Web App that runs the official ELSEPA 2021 Fortran
  programs (ELSCATA and ELSCATM) compiled to WebAssembly, for Dirac partial-wave
  calculations of elastic electron and positron scattering by atoms, ions and
  molecules. The bundled ELSEPA sources and data are licensed separately under
  CC BY-NC 3.0 by their authors.
keywords:
  - elastic electron scattering
  - Dirac partial-wave analysis
  - ELSEPA
  - positron scattering
  - WebAssembly
  - Progressive Web App
